    "slug": "adminstaffingsolutions-document-a-admin-role-intake-decision-without-overstepping",
    "title": "Document a admin role intake decision without overstepping",
    "description": "A grounded administrative staffing note for admin staffing agency owners: admin role intake with explicit evidence, decision rights, and a verified close.",
    "category": "decision rights",
