          "Each week, sample document formatting cases across owners, channels, and risk levels, including at least one unresolved case. Pair speed measures with evidence measures so a faster document formatting queue does not hide missing supply order or weak approvals. Keep the review notes with the document formatting batch so the next owner can see why the procedure changed. Give the review an owner and a follow-up date; a finding without an action is only an observation. The October 28 document formatting close should name the destination field, the approver, and the coverage fill time check."
